*> Literals whose values are keywords are still literals.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WORDS.
    05  FILLER PIC X(8) VALUE "USAGE".
    05  FILLER PIC X(8) VALUE "OCCURS".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN MODE = "ELSE"
            DISPLAY "WHEN"
        WHEN MODE = "END-IF"
            DISPLAY "PERFORM"
    END-EVALUATE
    IF CODE-TEXT = "THEN" DISPLAY "AT END" END-IF.
